From: zbai29 <zbai29@wisc.edu>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add a daemon-side browser_download tool

Fetch a URL inside a Paseo browser tab and write the checked bytes on the
daemon host. The desktop client is unchanged.

Rebased onto getpaseo/paseo v0.12.0 (cafe4b01c).

---
